[{"client_msg_id":"06B013BE-8841-4741-B847-2DDA47AAE217","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"任意のタイミングで設定できた方が柔軟に使えるってくらいで、具体的にそれがないと困るというシチュエーションはないすね","ts":"1622385102.047300","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1622385123.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WALPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9953a11f-2f6e-4ff6-aee8-76b6a9e5bbdd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"というのも経験上そういうことをしたいと思ったことがないので。バッファローカルナキーマッピングなんてそのバッファを開いたときにしか使わないから、開いた時に設定すれば済む","ts":"1622383485.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lt6YY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8676f873-1423-4bc3-85e8-7480b69b2e23","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それだけだと実際にどういうシチュエーションでその機能が使いたいのかがまったく伝わってこないと言う話をしていますね","ts":"1622383427.042800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ipHV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c4dbdea-4d30-4401-a724-f800a7c59f23","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なので、公開するライブラリを作っているわけではなく、自分がそういう関数を用意してプラグイン作るときに便利そうだよねって思っているという感じです","ts":"1622381405.042200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oWQKC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ecb48c5-cecc-44fb-8c6a-2e88a72eef08","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ほしいと思った理由は\nプラグインで使うバッファを管理するクラスで、特定のバッファにキーマップを設定する関数を使って\n必要なタイミングで必要なバッファにキーマップを設定したい\nというだけですね","ts":"1622381329.041400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Asvek"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05d2205e-b3df-432e-8a7d-436c3ecc0e8a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ライブラリを実装したい話はしていないですね","ts":"1622381202.039800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ep8O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3529c897-6734-4f1b-bc57-86d55207807a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ライブラリを実装したいと言うのはその機能がほしいシチュエーションの説明になっていません","ts":"1622381001.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dEb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"420569cc-2c26-4464-9e13-40575e083e4f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"別バッファにキーマッピングを設定したい話ですね","ts":"1622380973.039300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2hxg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11bc5b46-03ba-405f-88e7-b4c7dc331840","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"hrsh7thさんの話かな","ts":"1622380932.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ky8iu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca412e60-4854-4c2c-ab32-12175bf89299","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"と思ったらこっちの話じゃなかった","ts":"1622380918.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xP38"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1ec7474-664b-4727-b6d6-8dbc34c5899d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今作っているプラグイン内部で使うやつですね","ts":"1622380900.038200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kr8l0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92a99e55-1a51-45ab-8403-20d03c24eb8d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そのライブラリ自体はどういうシチュエーションで使う想定なのかな","ts":"1622380784.037800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZRU4="}]},{"client_msg_id":"e836222d-f753-4c12-8770-21f21d5a1dd1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょっとやってみます","ts":"1622380379.037400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gVLgq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f58c61b4-8276-420b-82ce-c5a044f84d85","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1622380373.037200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N4UfQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed123597-ec6c-4a26-9a91-e9f0eb889522","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうですね。それだとレイアウトが維持されます。\nですです。","ts":"1622380308.037000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JWj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"838016a8-6dae-4e0a-856e-1c8f0e50eef4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あたらしいウィンドウを作る必要がない","ts":"1622380301.036800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c+0F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1200283e-93d1-4349-97b7-1572efeea527","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"`:buf`を使えばいいのか","ts":"1622380292.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yfVZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb493b9c-9934-4039-a8b9-c1014c24b3fe","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、そっか","ts":"1622380282.035900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cgte"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a8a5544-c0af-4651-8244-6ea5d07f28a8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"keepaltとかは必要ですね","ts":"1622380232.035600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nxr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51d38b13-aa0c-44f7-9516-d07871fdf74f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、そうすね","ts":"1622380223.035300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M4f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"454c2a63-644b-488f-ba84-143bf61de40f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"noautocmd/keepalt/keepjumps/silent でバッファ移動の副作用を極力なくした状態で実際に移動して処理を実行する。同じ方法で戻ってくる。","ts":"1622380200.035000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J3L82"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f600c44-ef5e-410c-b4b0-7a7aecd215da","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003chttp://Buffer.do|Buffer.do\u003e 自体はそこそこシンプルです。\n```\"\n\" do\n\"\nfunction! s:do(bufnr, func) abort\n  let l:curr_bufnr = bufnr('%')\n  if l:curr_bufnr == a:bufnr\n    call a:func()\n    return\n  endif\n\n  try\n    execute printf('noautocmd keepalt keepjumps silent %sbuffer', a:bufnr)\n    call a:func()\n  catch /.*/\n    echomsg string({ 'exception': v:exception, 'throwpoint': v:throwpoint })\n  finally\n    execute printf('noautocmd keepalt keepjumps silent %sbuffer', l:curr_bufnr)\n  endtry\nendfunction```","ts":"1622380140.034100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qE91"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e9581fe-22c4-41d2-8e79-8ef86354c4c6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"buf_execute() 関数が本体にほしい","ts":"1622380098.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k1oPz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44a5ca64-4968-44f7-ac62-b2b7925010a6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バッファがウィンドウに居ないときは\n1. 新規ウィンドウを作る\n2. 画面描画を止める\n3. 新規ウィンドウに移動\n4. マップを設定\n5. 新規ウィンドウを閉じる\n6. 元のウィンドウに戻る\nこうか…","ts":"1622380083.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qt2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aec8d4c3-452b-435a-8292-d70624108e2e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"特定のファイルタイプのときに〜ではなく「実在する具体的な特定のバッファに」ということであれば、やはり vital-vs の \u003chttp://Buffer.do|Buffer.do\u003e 的な関数を用意してそれを使わせるほうがよさそうです。","ts":"1622380059.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"asVKC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36238f82-30e0-4fee-8bec-cce1d18d39ef","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そうですね、それならその操作がうごけばよさそう","ts":"1622379984.031000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ZJtD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7122ed74-80e6-4cd4-9db6-196442cfae7a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、バッファのウィンドウに移動してキーマップを設定して元のウィンドウに戻る\nのが良さそうな気がしてきた","ts":"1622379970.030700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vh051"}]},{"client_msg_id":"003c7ee5-8620-4aad-b0b2-11d0d0bd18f3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なので、ftのautocmdはちょっと実現難しいなと","ts":"1622379795.030200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QK4=5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74e8f9c0-6eb3-44b0-a746-57350da9b002","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど\n背景を説明すると\ndenopsでバッファを管理するクラスを作っていて、そこに `addKeyMap`みたいな関数を用意しようとしています\n指定した bufnr に指定した keymap を追加する、という動きをイメージしています","ts":"1622379690.029800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gEg3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c8950c4-6629-4dc1-82ea-8fa80467eea6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"その特定の、がどういう理由なのか不明なのでなんとも、たとえば特定の条件を判定して、とかあると思うので、条件しだいだとおもいます。","ts":"1622379548.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9GA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87eaeb0b-ccc0-4cbb-8146-3dffbdac2648","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"致し方なしか…","ts":"1622379525.027400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6=c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce15acfe-f804-4faa-b6f3-2176ec00936b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ft必須になるのか","ts":"1622379392.026900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5RO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34e898a8-744a-46ac-88b5-acd481dda95d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1622379383.026700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VFX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"327c465e-d049-4272-8c81-7891f351b362","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、えーと、たとえば `autocmd FileType hoge map \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; :Hoge` みたいなのを考えてました。\n要は、「特定のバッファ」の要件をautocmdで実現して、「そのバッファで」をmapのbufferで対応する、みたいな","ts":"1622379104.026300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kI7t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41cbe63e-5b8a-4f56-9265-bbaef9a1d0e2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、良さそうなイベントがなさげ","ts":"1622378844.025000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rMF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5f01de7-b6ae-4c1a-a411-bc55e11a1ab5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"その場で即座実行するのに、イベント何が良いかなあ","ts":"1622378630.024500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8zmR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dde9bf5-cc14-4f5c-9e56-bddfdc4f9069","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あー `\u0026lt;buffer=33\u0026gt;` みたいな表記ありましたね。使ったことないけど","ts":"1622378540.023800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CJT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7446d628-b657-485d-95e1-40af7a5ee4bf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"こういう感じか","ts":"1622378518.023300","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1622378520.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"62Dc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc466841-3159-476c-960f-e92a2550b082","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```    :au CursorHold \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt;  echo 'hold'\n    :au CursorHold \u0026lt;buffer=33\u0026gt;  echo 'hold'\n    :au BufNewFile * au CursorHold \u0026lt;buffer=abuf\u0026gt;  echo 'hold'```","ts":"1622378515.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KUZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"978cc971-153a-4c6f-9223-98d2aee0536b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"autocmdで特定のバッファか","ts":"1622378317.022800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cib9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ace2f558-1438-4d0d-b0e2-72412df7c64a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、rangeか","ts":"1622378282.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NUx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5f95016-d0d4-478a-814c-6d791619dd60","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"autocmdで特定のバッファにmap \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; してやるのがいいんじゃない?","ts":"1622378281.022500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kIS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1937f81-e25f-4bdc-8524-42a533836403","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"全バッファに対して実行してしまうのか","ts":"1622378251.021900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q62RJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cb684cf-5822-44cb-8aa4-5d15f8eed1ef","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ふむ","ts":"1622378240.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hpowb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29d322c6-5a7c-4be7-aad5-ae6dd95958af","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```\" Like bufdo but restore the current buffer.\nfunction! BufDo(command)\n  let currBuff=bufnr(\"%\")\n  execute 'bufdo ' . a:command\n  execute 'buffer ' . currBuff\nendfunction\ncom! -nargs=+ -complete=command Bufdo call BufDo(\u0026lt;q-args\u0026gt;)```","ts":"1622378238.021400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B9dj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f31d05c-f3dd-45f1-b32c-6fd2878c9437","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"被り力","ts":"1622378214.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HM4Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6218909a-9561-40e0-afc6-46dfc8f36d6a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"それいけそうすね","ts":"1622378208.021000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8t8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ccb9ac6-f670-445d-b396-14637e04607c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょうど bufdo 見つけた","ts":"1622378204.020800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TCsRM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b3eb215-7d82-407b-ab76-1374b5ec4958","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://vim.fandom.com/wiki/Run_a_command_in_multiple_buffers\u003e","ts":"1622378197.020500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Vim Tips Wiki: Run a command in multiple buffers | Vim Tips Wiki | Fandom","id":1,"title":"Run a command in multiple buffers | Vim Tips Wiki | Fandom","title_link":"https://vim.fandom.com/wiki/Run_a_command_in_multiple_buffers","text":"Run a command in multiple buffers | Vim Tips Wiki | Fandom","thumb_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/vim/images/b/bc/Wiki.png/revision/latest/zoom-crop/width/200/height/200?cb=20070515145358","blocks":null,"service_name":"Vim Tips Wiki","service_icon":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/vim/images/6/64/Favicon.ico/revision/latest?cb=20070606151428","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://vim.fandom.com/wiki/Run_a_command_in_multiple_buffers","original_url":"https://vim.fandom.com/wiki/Run_a_command_in_multiple_buffers"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j7Ee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bc1ebb2-924b-4af8-a7c1-aa68484113bc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ？","ts":"1622378195.020200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5dtK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"951f553c-e1e0-4676-a84c-8691d20b4a00","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; は現在のバッファに対してのみなので、ちょっと違うんですよね","ts":"1622378195.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSKuc"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *:bufdo*\n:[range]bufdo[!] {cmd}  {cmd} をバッファリスト内の各バッファに対して実行する。\n                        [range]が指定された場合は、指定された範囲の番号の\n                        バッファが操作対象となる。これは次のようにするのと同じ\n                        動作をする:  \n                                :bfirst\n                                :{cmd}\n                                :bnext\n                                :{cmd}\n                                etc.\n                        カレントファイルが破棄されえなく(|abandon|)かつ [!]が\n                        与えられない場合、このコマンドは失敗する。\n                        1つのバッファに対してエラーが検出されると、それ以降\n                        のバッファに対しては実行されない。\n                        リストされていないバッファはスキップされる。\n                        最後のバッファ (またはエラーが起こったバッファ) がカレ\n                        ントウィンドウになる。\n                        {cmd} は '|' を含んで複数のコマンドを連結していてもよ\n                        い。\n                        {cmd} はバッファリストにバッファを削除、追加してはなら\n                        ない。\n                        Note:このコマンドを実行している間、Syntax 自動コマンド\n                        イベントが 'eventignore' に追加され、無効化される。\n                        これは各バッファの編集を大幅にスピードアップさせる。\n                        |:tabdo|、|:argdo|、|:windo|、|:cdo|、|:ldo|、|:cfdo|、\n                        |:lfdo| も参照。\n \n例:  \n \n        :windo set nolist foldcolumn=0 | normal! zn\n \nこれは 'list' オプションをリセットし全てのウィンドウの折り畳みを無効化する。\n  \n        :bufdo set fileencoding= | update\n \nこれは各バッファの 'fileencoding' をリセットし、バッファに変更があったらそれを\n保存する。結果として、すべてのバッファが同じ 'encoding' のエンコーディングを使\n用する (変換が成功した場合)。\n```","ts":"1622378185.019700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"6cf47625-18cf-49dd-b42c-b3856c02e1ac","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h :bufdo","ts":"1622378185.019600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rduSs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13ead192-697a-44b7-a4a8-9f1505791ea6","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"map \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt;  hoge hugo とかですか?","ts":"1622378162.019100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9AgWf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e16b70a-4717-4324-8da9-36d2ded6667f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"特定のバッファでexコマンド実行できる方法、なにかあった気が…","ts":"1622378141.018600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nAxo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4da59c24-6559-40c7-83c6-59d5b903dc8b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"vimで特定のバッファにキーマップを設定する方法って何かありますか？","ts":"1622378062.018100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+nAQ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"\u003c@U0238G3KV8D\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622376122.016300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"\u003c@U76V658V6\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1622321836.016100","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
